text-info-secondary text-base leading-theme mb-gap4x min-h-[30px]" style="position:relative"><span data-slate-node="text" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-zero-width="n" data-slate-length="0">﻿<br/></span></span></span></div><div data-slate-node="element" data-slate-void="true" class="slate-media_embed relative" style="position:relative"><figure class="group relative" contentEditable="false"><div style="position:relative"><div style="max-width:100%;min-width:100px;position:relative;width:0" class="mx-auto"><div class="whitespace-nowrap leading-none rounded-[2px] css-ltr-u5515b-EmbedContentWrapper e1tfmbo30"><div style="left: 0; width: 100%; height: 0; position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.338%;"><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1124514056?h=965e1a8c1c&app_id=122963" style="top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; position: absolute; border: 0;" allowfullscreen scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media *;"></iframe></div></div></div></div></figure><div data-slate-spacer="true" style="height:0;color:transparent;outline:none;position:absolute"><span data-slate-node="text"><span data-slate-leaf="true"><span data-slate-zero-width="z" data-slate-length="0">﻿</span></span></span></div></div><div data-slate-node="element" class="slate-p relative m-0 px-0 text-info-secondary text-base leading-theme mb-gap4x min-h-[30px]" style="position:relative"><span data-slate-node="text" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-zero-width="n" data-slate-length="0">﻿<br/></span></span></span></div><div data-slate-node="element" class="slate-p relative m-0 px-0 text-info-secondary text-base leading-theme min-h-[11px] mb-gap4x" style="position:relative"><span data-slate-node="text" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-string="true">Across government, teams manage a steady flow of public information requests.

The process is essential, but it’s often repetitive, manual, and time-consuming.

In this short demo, </span></span></span><span style="font-size:0;line-height:0" contentEditable="false"> </span><a data-slate-node="element" data-slate-inline="true" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lauren-oliphant-9770a09a/" target="_blank" class="slate-a relative underline cursor-pointer text-theme-primary decoration-theme-primary" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="position:relative"><span data-slate-node="text" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-string="true">Lauren Oliphant</span></span></span><span style="font-size:0;line-height:0" contentEditable="false"> </span></a><span data-slate-node="text" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-leaf="true" style="color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span data-slate-string="true"> Solutions Engineer at OpenAI for Government, shows how a custom GPT can help:

 • Retrieve case details from approved data sources
 • Flag sensitive information for review and redaction
 • Draft courteous, constituent updates in seconds

The result: faster turnaround, less administrative strain, and more time for mission-critical work—while human staff retain full control over what’s released.

See how your agency could modernize its approach to information management.

Watch the demo and learn how to get started with a custom GPT.</span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div display="flex" class="css-ltr-11y0g5e-Box-breakpointValues egexii40" token="[object Object],[object Object]"></div></div></div><div class="css-ltr-13a0xg7-Divider e7qcmm31"></div><aside class="css-ltr-i8yg4d-Aside e7qcmm33"><div class="css-ltr-phu6r0-StickySidebar e7qcmm35"><div display="flex" class="tenant-relevant-popular-content-pane eix17jn1 css-ltr-jmknqm-Box-breakpointValues-Container egexii40" token="[object Object],[object Object]"><h2 font-size="21px" font-weight="600" name="large/LG-2-B" class="css-ltr-ck7aql-InnerText-breakpointValues e7j2cxr0">Popular</h2><div class="css-ltr-1nbihwp-CardsContainer eix17jn0"><div display="flex" class="e15yudk30 css-ltr-p5opfl-Box-breakpointValues-Container egexii40" token="[object Object],[object Object]"><a tabindex="-1" aria-label="Read more about &#x27;Organization and Automation: Managing Time and Tasks with AI&#x27;" aria-hidden="true" color="var(--theme-color-info, #1E1D29)" class="css-ltr-7hgg7d-StyledContentLink ertmvqj0 " href="/public/videos/organization-and-automation-managing-time-and-tasks-with-ai-2025-03-20"><div class="css-ltr-12v514s-Box-breakpointValues-Cover e15yudk32" token="[object Object],[object Object]"></div><div opacity="0.7" width="fit-content" style="padding-top:3px;padding-bottom:3px" class="css-ltr-dqwobb-Box-breakpointValues egexii40" token="[object Object],[object Object]"><div font-family="fontFamily" font-size="12px" font-weight="500" name="small/SM-2" color="colorInfoWhite" class="css-ltr-49ur0a-InnerText-breakpointValues e7j2cxr0">17:40</div></div></a><div display="flex" class="e15yudk31 css-ltr-yanrhg-Box-breakpointValues-InnerContainer egexii40" token="[object Object],[object Object]"><div font-family="fontFamily" font-size="14px" font-weight="500" name="small/SM-1" type="success" class="css-ltr-mzcrp3-InnerText-breakpointValues e7j2cxr0">Video</div><a tabindex="0